  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "歇熱ê台語生活   "
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>作者：劉閎翊</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（台北市溪口國小六年ê學生）</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tī tsiah-nī熱ê暑假，有一工，台語老師khà電話來講：「你beh參加9月底ê演說比賽，lán趁歇熱約一工來去學校練習台語。」啊！我頭殼mooh leh燒！</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Hit一日，老師準備真濟資料，教我演說比賽ài注意ê mê角、逐工ài整理一篇演說四格圖ê功課，而且ài錄音寄hōo老師聽。Tse是我頭一擺參加台語演說比賽，心內是真緊張。拄開始，逐擺交功課我lóng ài khai三、四點鐘tsiah ē-tàng完成，寫kah我tsiok想beh哭。M̄-koh老師真有耐心，每一擺lóng ē kā我提醒：「入聲聲短、ài收束，m是合脣音，ài發出聲……。」Tiānn-tiānn鼓勵我mài有siunn大ê壓力，hōo我漸漸感覺khah安心。老師koh有介紹台語『卡通』ê影片，內容真笑詼，我kap小弟逐工lóng ē看，看kah笑hai-hai。Tse是我練台語上輕鬆koh歡喜ê代誌！</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">經過一工koh一工ê練習，我tsit-má m̄免一點鐘就ē-sái完成錄音功課，老師mā呵咾講：「因為你tsiok認真，所以台語愈來愈liàn-tńg，內容koh-khah精彩，時間掌握kah tsiok拄好！」我聽了真歡喜，hōo我想著俗語講：「一枝草，一點露。」只要lán認真拍拚，一定ē沓沓仔進步。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tī歇熱tsit兩個月ê練習，我想beh感謝小弟陪我做伙看台語『卡通』，阮阿爸、阿母陪我練習講台語、查資料，上感謝老師tsiok用心教我台語，hōo我進步tsiânn濟，一直鼓勵我m̄-thang放棄。最後，我beh對家己講：「M̄管比賽ê結果是按怎，我lóng有用心認真去準備--ah，台語mā愈來愈liàn-tńg，tse是我上大ê收成！」希望tsit擺演說比賽順利完成。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（感謝施雅惠老師推薦投稿）</span></b></div><div><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEg1Xpo-MwP6GX_c-1vwoWDnG_8rNh3jwfbJmyKOsvMkWwbbMyORD4XzzkkavY0XEdLt61bWIfhGRTdd_d38th2vja-fe4FTYesA_nM46-QLG6a4Ngd2w4eT8sCPERRxQL0BTcCD4cqT-mQ8WFXUuOiahIlAjhH_UpYfozuThOT1rQhNKnVPWLkwzuvL-g=s1424\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEg1Xpo-MwP6GX_c-1vwoWDnG_8rNh3jwfbJmyKOsvMkWwbbMyORD4XzzkkavY0XEdLt61bWIfhGRTdd_d38th2vja-fe4FTYesA_nM46-QLG6a4Ngd2w4eT8sCPERRxQL0BTcCD4cqT-mQ8WFXUuOiahIlAjhH_UpYfozuThOT1rQhNKnVPWLkwzuvL-g=w450-h640\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgbGuJoxc9YtFPT4q38xDy0WtoF0zs1QLA9ZRZCYm5_Xtkv_op70rxwlixYqn-IpIMkRwRRu7idlXb7WNbheNGT4_kUww5YRRM899W3iNc1aiqo6Aekla3RUb-3hoQZVjaOFVP5O6rIp5fFqxNFiiNgIG_QC7BVigexQ9CI3Nx93cXY_QqaftiVMjgCSg=s3036\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgbGuJoxc9YtFPT4q38xDy0WtoF0zs1QLA9ZRZCYm5_Xtkv_op70rxwlixYqn-IpIMkRwRRu7idlXb7WNbheNGT4_kUww5YRRM899W3iNc1aiqo6Aekla3RUb-3hoQZVjaOFVP5O6rIp5fFqxNFiiNgIG_QC7BVigexQ9CI3Nx93cXY_QqaftiVMjgCSg=w454-h640\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><div><span><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\">#</b><span><span><b>心內話&nbsp;</b><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\">專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。&nbsp;</b></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報334期，2022年1月出刊。</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div align=\"center\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: large; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(定期定額) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(單筆) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #050505; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span></div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left;\"></span></div><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 15px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span><br /><span style=\"color: #999999;\"><br /></span></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: medium;\"></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></span></div></div></div></div><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div></div>"
  },
